WEBVTT

00:52.160 --> 00:55.080
I-Impossible...

00:56.080 --> 00:58.040
My puppet soldiers...

01:01.500 --> 01:04.190
You lost, Basteo.

01:05.170 --> 01:07.460
D-Demon Lord...

01:07.460 --> 01:10.470
You have two options.

01:11.590 --> 01:15.600
You either commit suicide
and die with honor...

01:16.430 --> 01:18.600
...or being killed by me here.

01:32.660 --> 01:35.030
From today on,
I am the Demon Lord!

03:01.410 --> 03:07.080
THE STRONGEST MAGICIAN
IN THE DEMON LORD'S ARMY WAS A HUMAN

03:09.420 --> 03:13.970
#5 AMBITION

03:33.150 --> 03:36.150
Kill all who resist!

03:36.610 --> 03:40.450
My world is about to begin from now on!

04:09.310 --> 04:12.320
You can understand
when looking at the situation, right?

04:12.690 --> 04:15.490
The Demon Lord's army is under my control.

04:16.380 --> 04:18.650
It's not too late

04:18.650 --> 04:21.240
for you to come join my army.

04:21.240 --> 04:25.540
I'll let you become the general
of the 7th Legion.

04:36.590 --> 04:38.840
That's not a bad offer,

04:38.840 --> 04:41.340
but that's not something
you should be talking about.

04:41.340 --> 04:42.850
What?

04:43.470 --> 04:44.600
Because...

04:45.680 --> 04:50.670
You will never become the Demon Lord.

05:04.330 --> 05:07.830
I thought you were smart,
but I guess you're just foolish.

05:17.260 --> 05:20.300
Then, this is where you meet your end.

05:23.640 --> 05:26.090
Raging Storm!

05:38.820 --> 05:39.900
Kill him!

05:45.200 --> 05:46.990
Dark Lance.

06:06.760 --> 06:08.310
Barrier.

06:36.080 --> 06:37.840
Death Rain.

06:46.890 --> 06:49.220
I-Impossible...!

06:59.940 --> 07:01.480
Hell Blast.

07:33.770 --> 07:36.440
Did you think this was the end?

07:52.280 --> 07:54.660
Too bad.

07:54.660 --> 07:57.750
An attack like that won't stop us.

07:58.100 --> 08:02.630
How could a member of
the Immortal Brigade like you forget that?

08:13.850 --> 08:15.600
I'm a Dullahan,

08:15.600 --> 08:18.060
and my soldiers are undead.

08:18.060 --> 08:20.400
We are the Undead Legion.

08:32.320 --> 08:34.120
Freeze.

08:42.920 --> 08:44.380
Clairvoyance.

09:09.820 --> 09:13.160
My army is capable of endless combat.

09:13.160 --> 09:16.410
It doesn't matter how skilled
you are as a magician,

09:16.410 --> 09:20.120
your magic power will eventually run out.

09:20.500 --> 09:22.000
How regrettable.

09:22.000 --> 09:25.090
If you were my subordinate,
I would have put you to good use.

09:45.150 --> 09:47.230
Are you still alive?

09:47.230 --> 09:50.030
As expected of the leader
of the Immortal Brigade.

09:50.030 --> 09:52.150
But your struggle is futile.

09:52.150 --> 09:55.120
Let's end this.

09:55.660 --> 09:59.950
At this rate, I'll exhaust my magic power.

09:59.950 --> 10:02.580
I need another plan.

10:02.580 --> 10:05.420
The undead are just moving corpses.

10:05.420 --> 10:07.750
Dark magic has little effect on them.

10:07.750 --> 10:09.340
Corpses...

10:09.340 --> 10:10.550
Corpses, huh?

10:14.720 --> 10:16.220
Have you given up?

10:18.680 --> 10:20.390
But I won't spare you!

10:20.390 --> 10:21.640
Kill him!

10:32.150 --> 10:35.110
W-What is that?!

10:39.850 --> 10:41.700
What's going on?!

10:51.760 --> 10:53.470
Sorry to keep you waiting.

11:13.570 --> 11:15.150
Get lost!

11:15.910 --> 11:18.200
Attack!

11:25.250 --> 11:26.710
Lord Ike!

11:26.710 --> 11:29.210
I'm coming to you!

11:32.920 --> 11:36.510
We just finished dealing
with those outside.

11:36.510 --> 11:37.680
Cefiro!

11:37.680 --> 11:39.510
There's no need to worry about her.

11:40.470 --> 11:42.930
Your opponent is Ike.

11:47.100 --> 11:48.900
Demon Lord?

11:48.900 --> 11:51.270
I'll give you one more chance.

11:57.070 --> 11:59.070
Have a duel with Ike.

11:59.620 --> 12:03.010
If you win, I will spare your life.

12:04.120 --> 12:05.190
What?

12:10.960 --> 12:15.970
THE STRONGEST MAGICIAN
IN THE DEMON LORD'S ARMY WAS A HUMAN

12:36.320 --> 12:39.910
I can handle him easily.

12:56.090 --> 12:59.630
Don't get too cocky!

13:00.470 --> 13:02.510
Demon Buster!

13:09.390 --> 13:12.350
I'm stronger than you are!

13:12.770 --> 13:15.820
I'll kill you right here!

13:15.820 --> 13:18.280
If you want to blame someone,
blame the Demon Lord!

13:19.190 --> 13:22.490
Come on! Beg me for mercy!

13:30.710 --> 13:32.080
You fool!

13:39.010 --> 13:39.800
What?!

13:55.150 --> 13:57.520
So, that really is White Magic.

13:57.520 --> 13:58.690
When did he learn that—

13:58.690 --> 14:01.570
No... How long has he been hiding
that he can use that magic?

14:04.030 --> 14:06.970
The Demon Lord isn't surprised?

14:31.350 --> 14:34.020
What are you doing, Ike?

14:34.020 --> 14:35.730
Nothing.

14:35.730 --> 14:39.230
Then, let's start studying magic.

14:39.230 --> 14:40.480
Yeah.

14:47.530 --> 14:48.410
I did it!

14:56.750 --> 14:57.790
Umm...

14:57.790 --> 15:01.130
Is there a spell that can bring
a withered flower back to life?

15:01.130 --> 15:04.050
That belongs to the realm of White Magic.

15:04.420 --> 15:06.760
Grandpa, I want to learn that.

15:06.760 --> 15:10.590
Ike, you're still a demon.

15:10.590 --> 15:14.060
You should be trying to learn about
curse magic, instead of White Magic.

15:15.270 --> 15:21.230
White Magic is a very difficult magic
for demons to use.

15:21.230 --> 15:22.280
Why?

15:22.280 --> 15:27.700
It differs from other forms of magic
as it stems from a heart of mercy.

15:27.700 --> 15:30.500
A pure and caring heart...

15:31.080 --> 15:33.730
That is something demons just don't have.

15:34.330 --> 15:36.330
But, even so...

15:37.150 --> 15:41.090
Right, you have a human heart.

15:41.710 --> 15:43.680
But you need to remember...

15:43.680 --> 15:50.590
For those with magic power, White Magic
can be more dangerous than any weapon.

15:52.140 --> 15:58.980
Even if you learn White Magic,
it's best to keep it under wraps.

15:59.310 --> 16:00.770
I understand.

16:00.770 --> 16:03.440
Good, let's begin.

16:07.570 --> 16:12.660
It seems like becoming the Demon Lord
was too big an ambition for you.

16:13.540 --> 16:15.200
Even though your army is undead,

16:15.200 --> 16:19.960
you've chosen to sacrifice your
subordinates for your own gain.

16:19.960 --> 16:23.090
You turn your blade on
your master and companions.

16:23.090 --> 16:25.670
Maybe that was the right thing
to do as a demon,

16:25.670 --> 16:29.260
but I just can't forgive you.

16:29.260 --> 16:31.180
A world in which one tramples on others

16:31.180 --> 16:34.140
and rises to the pinnacle is not right.

16:42.650 --> 16:44.520
You can't forgive me?!

16:44.520 --> 16:46.360
Who do you think you are?!

16:46.360 --> 16:47.300
Shut up!

16:48.570 --> 16:51.570
This is the end for you.

16:52.200 --> 16:54.580
Die!

16:55.160 --> 16:57.500
Sorry, Grandpa.

16:57.500 --> 16:59.120
I'm going to use it.

17:02.580 --> 17:04.710
Holy Light Destruction.

17:10.130 --> 17:13.600
W-What is this?!

17:14.180 --> 17:16.970
Impossible!

17:27.940 --> 17:31.910
Did Lord Romberg teach you that magic?

17:32.410 --> 17:33.150
Yes.

17:33.990 --> 17:36.200
Anyway, you've defeated him.

17:36.200 --> 17:39.010
It seems like you anticipated this
from the very start.

17:39.540 --> 17:41.470
And you weren't at the duel

17:41.470 --> 17:43.530
as you were preparing things
to support me.

17:45.420 --> 17:47.960
At any rate, there's no problem
since you won, right?

17:47.960 --> 17:49.550
There is a problem.

17:52.970 --> 17:54.550
Demon Lord?

17:54.550 --> 18:00.020
With Basteo's rebellion,
the 3rd Legion has no general.

18:00.520 --> 18:04.560
Ike is going to have to take
responsibility for this matter.

18:04.560 --> 18:06.360
Take responsibility?

18:06.730 --> 18:11.070
Ike, you will become
the general of the 3rd Legion.

18:11.820 --> 18:12.720
What?

18:13.490 --> 18:15.780
I'm waiting for a good answer.

18:22.000 --> 18:24.210
Lord Ike, thank goodness you are safe!

18:24.210 --> 18:26.920
I'm really happy to hear that.

18:26.920 --> 18:29.210
Hey, you, get out of here.

18:29.210 --> 18:31.340
- I should be the one standing next to him!
- No, I won't leave him again!

18:31.340 --> 18:34.930
- Your ugly crying face looks even worse now!
- I want to do it right now!

18:35.760 --> 18:38.220
I don't care if I am becoming ugly.

18:42.430 --> 18:44.850
Ike is my subordinate.

18:44.850 --> 18:48.480
The authority to manage his appointment
belongs to me, his superior.

18:48.480 --> 18:51.780
How surprising.
I thought you would approve of this.

18:53.490 --> 18:55.570
But if that's the case...

18:55.570 --> 18:57.660
You are my subordinate.

18:57.660 --> 19:00.740
So Ike is also my subordinate.

19:00.740 --> 19:03.500
Even so, Ike is mine!

19:03.810 --> 19:04.920
Well.

19:04.920 --> 19:07.210
Let's hear the answer from him.

19:07.540 --> 19:08.540
Ike?

19:10.210 --> 19:11.920
Have you made your decision?

19:15.430 --> 19:16.430
Yes.

19:25.060 --> 19:26.290
I don't understand!

19:28.400 --> 19:29.900
What's going on here?!

19:29.900 --> 19:32.360
Did you reveal your identity
to the Demon Lord?!

19:32.360 --> 19:34.900
Please quiet down.

19:34.900 --> 19:37.450
Others are going to find out.

19:38.030 --> 19:41.240
So why wasn't the Demon Lord
surprised about what you did?

19:41.240 --> 19:44.080
You seem pretty calm about this!

19:44.080 --> 19:45.830
What on earth is going on?!

19:51.800 --> 19:55.090
The citizens are finally
getting used to the new city.

19:55.470 --> 19:56.720
Ike...

19:56.720 --> 19:58.550
My subordinates

19:58.550 --> 20:01.790
were a bit confused by the idea
of living with humans at first,

20:01.790 --> 20:04.570
but now, they're getting used to it.

20:04.570 --> 20:06.520
The humans feel that too.

20:48.190 --> 20:49.300
How is it?

20:49.300 --> 20:50.650
Is it good?

20:53.820 --> 20:59.070
I mentioned this to Lady Cefiro
before she became my master.

20:59.070 --> 21:00.910
W-Wait, Ike.

21:00.910 --> 21:02.030
That's...

21:02.030 --> 21:04.370
My goal...

21:04.370 --> 21:07.450
...is the coexistence of demons and humans.

21:14.840 --> 21:17.420
Forgive me, Demon Lord.

21:18.090 --> 21:23.390
I still have much to learn from Lady Cefiro.

21:24.300 --> 21:26.130
In exchange, I will promise you this.

21:29.060 --> 21:30.060
Amazing.

21:37.480 --> 21:38.810
I will make Ivalies...

21:39.400 --> 21:43.160
...the first city where demons
and humans coexist.

21:57.300 --> 21:59.010
I see.

23:34.520 --> 23:38.440
DWARF KING
